[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0010","text":"（歌单，会变成什么样呢────）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0020","text":"（其他组合，一定都是\n　开开心心和和气气地搞吧……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0030","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0040","text":"────即便如此，也只能做下去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0060","text":"啊，您早上好……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0070","text":"早上好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0080","text":"那个……\n你们是在练习下次演唱会要唱的歌吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0090","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0100","text":"因为我觉得应该也会有全员一起的表演\n所以在考虑舞台上该怎么展现"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0110","text":"────是、是这样啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0120","text":"这次的演唱会\n我觉得也会根据歌曲不同，展现方式也会不一样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0130","text":"但是，要把最棒的表演\n传递给大家，这一点不会变"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0140","text":"……是的\n说得对────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0150","text":"────会是什么样的舞台呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0160","text":"那个，现在还不好说……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0170","text":"只能不断尝试，去创造出来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0180","text":"……啊、那个，我也────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0190","text":"诶"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0200","text":"那个……\n我也想尝试各种各样的东西────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0210","text":"所以，那个────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0220","text":"美琴小姐在想些什么，\n可以教教我吗……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0230","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0240","text":"对、对不起……！　我────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0250","text":"没事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0260","text":"我的想法不一定是对的\n但一起创造吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0270","text":"好、好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0280","text":"啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0290","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0300","text":"（虽然得走了，\n　但总觉得……不太好搭话啊────）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0310","text":"怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0320","text":"啊，不好意思……！\n我想到差不多该离开这里了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0016","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0330","text":"真的呢\n完全没注意到"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0340","text":"得去准备了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0017","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0350","text":"啊，好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0018","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0360","text":"不好意思，是我……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0019","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0370","text":"美、美琴小姐！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0380","text":"下一节训练取消了，\n说我们可以再用一会儿！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0023","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0390","text":"这样啊\n那就继续练习吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_07_0400","text":"好的……！"}]
